{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25068502536145843", "organization": {"id": "100858266155808", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "25068502536145843"}]}, "id": "796400729693738"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "28627787526867149"}]}, "id": "832400032360373"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "25068502536145843", "release_date": 1785564000, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26377362965259787"}, "id": "1362456342157785"}]}}, "binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25068502536145843", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26377362965259787"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "id": "26377362965259787", "version": "1.0.0", "version_code": 1, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1778738488, "id": "26819493887713357", "is_initial_release": true, "name_with_fallback": "v2", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 2, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "26819524164376996"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "25068502536145843"}, "id": "26819524164376996", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "25068502536145843", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "837234438698397"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1725462555533755", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Apostel Paulus und das Geld", "keywords": ["paul", "money", "minigames", "exhibition", "historic"], "long_description": "Apostel Paulus war einer der wichtigsten Unterst\u00fctzer des fr\u00fchen Christentums und ma\u00dfgeblich an dessen Verbreitung beteiligt. \u00dcber viele Jahre besuchte er als Wandermissionar St\u00e4dte in Griechenland und der T\u00fcrkei, um den Namen Jesu Christi zu verbreiten und unz\u00e4hlige Gemeinden zu gr\u00fcnden.\nBegleite ihn zu den wichtigsten Station auf seinen Reisen, um die Antike und ihren Umgang mit Geld genauer zu verstehen. Besuche dabei historische St\u00e4dte wie Korinth, um mit handwerklicher Arbeit Geld zu verdienen. Verwalte die Kollekte in Antiochia und verteidige dich gegen einen w\u00fctenden Mob am Fu\u00dfe des Tempels der Artemis, einem Weltwunder der Antike.\n\nEntdecke eine digitale Ausstellung, gef\u00fcllt mit hochaufl\u00f6senden 3-D-Scans von M\u00fcnzen, die zu den Lebzeiten von Paulus genutzt wurden. Lerne von Experten des SFB 1391 der Universit\u00e4t T\u00fcbingen mehr \u00fcber die damalige Zeit und reise daf\u00fcr fast 2000 Jahre in die Zeit zur\u00fcck, um die damalige Zeit in drei Minispielen zu erleben:\n\n- Teppich-Puzzle: Hilf Paulus bei seiner Arbeit als Zeltmacher, um Geld f\u00fcr die Entwicklung neuer Gemeinden in Korinth zu verdienen\n- Handgemenge: Verteidige dich gegen einen w\u00fctenden Mob am Tempel der Artemis in Ephesus\n- M\u00fcnzwurf: Organisiere die Kollekte deiner Gemeinden in Jerusalem, indem du sie in verschiedene Beutel wirfst", "short_description": "\u201eApostel Paulus und das Geld\u201c, eine interaktive Ausstellung mit originalen Artefakten, Minispielen und weiteren \u00dcberraschungen. Besuche spannende Orte, meistere spa\u00dfige Minispiele und knacke den lokalen Highscore!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Meta_Landscape Cover.png", "id": "2208337449689257", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_2208337456355923_3067081150388982893_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SEpL3_48PdsQ7kNvwFbCVDz&_nc_oc=AdrO-1gZuMVLTuLaSAuxqmbTYuQNhxOEwnD0qpYvgB9xMc-eNPAZDzkGFCrG__fLzM0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEsWaTt0j1VglB52o9p2c8HfDiuMjRbR6YMM8F5oUfW_Q&oe=6A973497"}, {"file_name": "App Icon_Large.png", "id": "1381964816972944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303391_1381964823639610_8598526299113846376_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KVVFuSp0AHMQ7kNvwFr1byd&_nc_oc=Adp4Vntb2kheKtq32GLqwr1GdcMfV_jnImTLbE8wXftufzrAaSbPsbCubwqv1jOxT7o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEGp20ultU19a45S-pjCoRrKs1bjlHX5DFgYBI0K51H2Q&oe=6A973D8E"}, {"file_name": "Meta_Logo.png", "id": "1380819417000735", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_1380819420334068_849090511407372674_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UXaGJ9Pap18Q7kNvwEyN0CX&_nc_oc=AdqCtV7nlm3NZ4WqC9WIEDFMexBZCFDzDJdaG_T5sxF7XE4G_p5TlON0XScGsGMvrsE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHJnmGdbGpU3gxe_pg5kvg0Lk8L4w1VTFl6lhoRzw1TRQ&oe=6A974A2C"}, {"file_name": "360 Preview_compressed.png", "id": "1376928754147100", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821782_1376928757480433_7056218612186307300_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iVi0qR_pL8AQ7kNvwHC37KG&_nc_oc=AdqIlDb5LLKK44bIs-IQBwnMMkmRB2TvzxYdhtFfFsJS_FpPwJ5y1lJNXwhYLBfGUaQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF6FNH7YooXZ8rP8J-lLKPhexuuJBKtumyatoIZR_lEFQ&oe=6A971BDC"}, {"file_name": "Meta_Square Cover.png", "id": "1100457611966751", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821674_1100457615300084_1985740767470137189_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u4YjE4kaNAUQ7kNvwGq6hoO&_nc_oc=Ado_lipB1b-J5Zts8v5WnWAyPZE39NX-vs5nNKC-F_3ETu4vPyAh5QuwRGgWqT_KVks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG1KPO3UISsuUMZm1MzNqCAvS9GDdT-m_a_ie0lY0iWEA&oe=6A975132"}, {"file_name": "Meta_Hero Cover.png", "id": "1082290533838302", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823757_1082290537171635_1342092228499673540_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aixCimUPi2kQ7kNvwErRSS9&_nc_oc=AdqnZ__HbfgIbfAks5aDTY5q7gOSviWkc91OzLezd2tapXrmaXRMZXEfJgbyBE492og&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHUNXKWY_qlLGGHM16eI-4P63fhXvYuTgv2IKgS8pQxqg&oe=6A97384F"}, {"file_name": "Meta_Portrait Cover.png", "id": "721533220971389", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824671_721533230971388_9175341973970190101_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WGaoRQT1Eo4Q7kNvwEFBfSm&_nc_oc=AdpdvD_Gephhk_mCQ4foAnDZFsx7Bkh6WXqVdGwtF-ZZQOpKHljtRK0SL8i4j4GNyqg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH7J8_oVhJRhiLU_r2jFeYO3_0-5fgmbS0fd0v_743nRQ&oe=6A975253"}]}, "id": "1496714748777632", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "Screenshot 3.png", "id": "1182400310434511", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_1182400313767844_7933376062795224034_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0RgcO0XHjAAQ7kNvwHvQwDB&_nc_oc=AdoU9qWY4L7aIUgIFjcPQV2TvxC77V2IaifKU19SeZtVz_PvcU2LrcoReTcidrvoYRQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE1nnEwcoUKC_2OdI492B8LyLMe3LLyk82rDqNb_6eSAg&oe=6A973C30"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 5.png", "id": "1179004484162182", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824671_1179004494162181_4290297978214241264_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TnAPGXrLyxIQ7kNvwEvjNtn&_nc_oc=Adoyg_WoE6izhQDcJDUYRuaUYLNgwezgSrfnFesib6oxpPsU35g4z54rfUaWu_3amlw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEu_aZGFK63habjijt2huzfWkE1tuOp4gQenwaigtZrog&oe=6A97498F"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 1.png", "id": "1759961598020072", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_1759961601353405_4081724765438815687_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6QAnyiLAf_cQ7kNvwFRj8DK&_nc_oc=Adr72IhWjHdLkEkK4PhXsg4c48w51AHAxhnw0mgbxrjNcU6i7mdn14TDkSkQEuMYjbA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGsBQvyouUMi6Hwp6NBiWmxDRuGvI9IhLScDycF3U3vRA&oe=6A973834"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 4.png", "id": "812498168226074", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828806_812498171559407_3345272315890078088_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1pzhCIafAl4Q7kNvwEPMTh_&_nc_oc=AdpqSVsM1vB-MLkLe4lSG6e9bBWk7ufQDNagPpsIVWWhrQIoQm8QMfu7TTTFBqKJIb4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQECf3VaVwQW1orNeIfLk8iIDtmBo7lHZDV9hy2TaPmGVQ&oe=6A9721CF"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2.png", "id": "613121295157584", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823271_613121301824250_5175741631686056358_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4iPcP1lKdtAQ7kNvwFqYySv&_nc_oc=AdqTS5I8km_WXTGJtn76P5UZYpo8fBr7GOE0fuLx8bCq-L4ylTIohIolpjDidnhgJKU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEMHfzL9i4t20bIaE29fyclp31p_-7EDgkd_1a7tnevHw&oe=6A974620"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Apostle Paul and Money", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Apostle Paul was one of the most important supporters of early Christianity and played a key role in its spread. For many years, he traveled as an itinerant missionary to cities in Greece and Turkey to spread the name of Jesus Christ and establish countless communities.\nAccompany him to the most important stops on his travels to gain a deeper understanding of ancient times and how money was handled. Visit historic cities such as Corinth to earn money through craftsmanship. Manage the collection in Antioch and defend yourself against an angry mob at the foot of the Temple of Artemis, one of the wonders of the ancient world.\n\nEnjoy an exhibition filled with high-quality 3D scans of real coins used during Paul's lifetime. Learn about the ancient times with information curated by history experts of the SFB 1391 at the University of T\u00fcbingen and experience life almost 2000 years ago playing three mini-games:\n- Cloth Puzzle: Help Paul work his day job as a tentmaker to earn money while evolving new congregations in Corinth\n- Scuffle: Defend yourself from an angry mob at the Temple of Artemis in Ephesos\n- Coin Throw: Organize the collections for your congregations in Jerusalem by throwing them into bags", "short_description": "\u201cApostle Paul and Money,\u201d an interactive exhibition featuring original artifacts, mini-games, and other surprises. Visit exciting places, master fun mini-games, and beat the local high score!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://paulus.luca-dreiling.de/meta_privacy_en.php", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "eisclimberStudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://paulus.luca-dreiling.de/index.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26819524164376996"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821674_1100457615300084_1985740767470137189_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u4YjE4kaNAUQ7kNvwGq6hoO&_nc_oc=Ado_lipB1b-J5Zts8v5WnWAyPZE39NX-vs5nNKC-F_3ETu4vPyAh5QuwRGgWqT_KVks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGgdbNhr0ZPz8feaUSao-AArutqXVqJ0puzL3K38s8VHA&oe=6A975132"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Apostle Paul and Money", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Learning", "id": "1043107547362485"}], "release_date": 1785564000, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "25068502599479170", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "25068502536145843", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "837234438698397"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1784403012233856", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Apostel Paulus und das Geld", "keywords": ["paul", "money", "minigames", "exhibition", "historic"], "long_description": "Apostel Paulus war einer der wichtigsten Unterst\u00fctzer des fr\u00fchen Christentums und ma\u00dfgeblich an dessen Verbreitung beteiligt. \u00dcber viele Jahre besuchte er als Wandermissionar St\u00e4dte in Griechenland und der T\u00fcrkei, um den Namen Jesu Christi zu verbreiten und unz\u00e4hlige Gemeinden zu gr\u00fcnden.\nBegleite ihn zu den wichtigsten Station auf seinen Reisen, um die Antike und ihren Umgang mit Geld genauer zu verstehen. Besuche dabei historische St\u00e4dte wie Korinth, um mit handwerklicher Arbeit Geld zu verdienen. Verwalte die Kollekte in Antiochia und verteidige dich gegen einen w\u00fctenden Mob am Fu\u00dfe des Tempels der Artemis, einem Weltwunder der Antike.\n\nEntdecke eine digitale Ausstellung, gef\u00fcllt mit hochaufl\u00f6senden 3-D-Scans von M\u00fcnzen, die zu den Lebzeiten von Paulus genutzt wurden. Lerne von Experten des SFB 1391 der Universit\u00e4t T\u00fcbingen mehr \u00fcber die damalige Zeit und reise daf\u00fcr fast 2000 Jahre in die Zeit zur\u00fcck, um die damalige Zeit in drei Minispielen zu erleben:\n\n- Teppich-Puzzle: Hilf Paulus bei seiner Arbeit als Zeltmacher, um Geld f\u00fcr die Entwicklung neuer Gemeinden in Korinth zu verdienen\n- Handgemenge: Verteidige dich gegen einen w\u00fctenden Mob am Tempel der Artemis in Ephesus\n- M\u00fcnzwurf: Organisiere die Kollekte deiner Gemeinden in Jerusalem, indem du sie in verschiedene Beutel wirfst", "short_description": "\u201eApostel Paulus und das Geld\u201c, eine interaktive Ausstellung mit originalen Artefakten, Minispielen und weiteren \u00dcberraschungen. Besuche spannende Orte, meistere spa\u00dfige Minispiele und knacke den lokalen Highscore!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Meta_Landscape Cover.png", "id": "2208337449689257", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_2208337456355923_3067081150388982893_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SEpL3_48PdsQ7kNvwFbCVDz&_nc_oc=AdrO-1gZuMVLTuLaSAuxqmbTYuQNhxOEwnD0qpYvgB9xMc-eNPAZDzkGFCrG__fLzM0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEsWaTt0j1VglB52o9p2c8HfDiuMjRbR6YMM8F5oUfW_Q&oe=6A973497"}, {"file_name": "App Icon_Large.png", "id": "1381964816972944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_I